      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers - We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nOne of the finest bungalows to come to the market in Portlaoise in recent years, this jaw-droppingly beautiful 4-bedroom home has recently been refurbished to an extraordinary standard and comes to the market in showhouse condition.\n\nElm lawn is an exclusive beautiful small development of quality detached homes with a magnificent green area for family recreation. No. 12 is set close to the entrance and with no property directly behind, it offers a level of privacy seldom found in today's market.\n\nNicely set back from the road, the property oozes kerb appeal with its tarmac driveway and new sliding sash windows, confirming it as a home of distinction.\nStep through the front door and be prepared for a jaw-droppingly beautiful interior.\n\nThe interior is presented to an exceptional standard, with stylish décor, quality finishes and an abundance of natural light throughout. A bright, welcoming entrance hall features elegant wall panelling and attractive flooring, immediately setting the tone for this beautifully maintained home. \n\nThe spacious living room is equally impressive, with warm timber flooring, decorative panelling and a feature stove creating a comfortable and inviting setting.\n\nA separate dining room provides excellent space for family dining and entertaining, complemented by built-in shelving and a contemporary inset fireplace. Conveniently positioned alongside is the separate kitchen, creating a practical and well-arranged living layout.\n\nThe bedroom accommodation comprises four bright and well-proportioned rooms, each individually styled and beautifully presented. One bedroom is currently arranged as a home office, demonstrating the excellent flexibility of the accommodation, while another benefits from a smartly finished ensuite shower room. A family bathroom completes this superb interior, which is offered in true walk-in condition.\n\nTo the rear is a beautiful private garden. With a large lawn area and being totally secluded, the property is a haven for family living. \n\nPerhaps one of the finest features of this beautiful home is the large detached concrete-built garage which offer tremendous opportunities for a multiple of uses.\n\nThe property is within walking distance of schools, shops, train station and town centre.\n\n The new Portlaoise bus service stops adjacent to the entrance giving round the clock access to all of the towns excellent facilities. There is a Tesco and Dunnes Stores within walking distance.\n\nViewing of this stunning home is highly recommended.\n"
      },
